{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-dm-recovery-readiness",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Dameng (DM8) recoverability assessment: whether this database can be recovered, to which point (LSN/time), and what would be lost — across 16 recovery scenarios (logical corruption, media failure, cluster/disaster), with scenario-by-scenario requirement-vs-actual comparison and targeted advice. Read-only by design: no scanning, no repair, no config changes. · 达梦数据库可恢复能力评估：这套库在 16 类恢复场景下能不能恢复、能恢复到哪一点（LSN/时间）、要丢什么，逐场景给出「要求 vs 本库实际」对照与针对性建议。只读设计：不扫描、不修复、不改配置。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Shiyuedong-Jade/DM-recovery.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Shiyuedong-Jade/DM-recovery#readme",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "selftest": "node tools/triage.mjs selftest"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.1-0 <4.1.0-0 || >=4.0.5-0 <4.1.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.1.0-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.1-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.2-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.3-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.4-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.5-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0-0"
